        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana FDBB134, 1-3/4\" Modern Cube Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDeltana's 1-3/4\" modern cube door stop is mounted to the floor, allowing the bottom of the door to contact it. It is easy to install with the included mounting hardware. If using near a wall, you want to mount this in a position so that the bumper makes contact before the door lever hits the wall. Thus protecting not just the door, but the wall and door lever as well. Available Matte Black, Polished or Brushed Stainless Steel finishes.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-FDBB134-size.jpg?v=1704354592\" width\"600\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana FDBB134 Modern Cube Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana FDBB134 Modern Cube Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/4\" Cube</li>\r\n<!-- <li>Mounting Hardware: #12 x 1-1/2\" screw plus plastic anchor</li> -->\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper Color: Black</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FDBB134.pdf?v=1704262383\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana FDBB134 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
